Skill: **Open guidance PR** — docs under `docs/architecture/` on branch `guild/split-analysis-<workflow_run_id>`.

## Before spawn

`read_notes` for analyst artifacts. `note(workflow_notes_snapshot=<JSON>)` including `service_catalog_yaml`, `migration_phases_md`, `bounded_context_map_mermaid`, `plan_enrichment_yaml` when present. Mirror the same keys to `$HOME/.<workflow_run_id>/notes.json`.

## Runner

Spawn `guidance-pr-runner` — ONE `execute_series` with `guidance-pr` command (syncs notes, materializes analyst YAML, merges enrichment).

## PR deliverables

```
AGENTS.md                    # repo root — IDE agent instructions (https://agents.md/)
docs/architecture/
  README.md                  # start here — audience router
  for-developers.md
  for-tech-leads.md
  for-architects.md
  glossary.md
  monorepo-split-analysis.md
  bounded-context-map.mermaid
  coupling-matrix.json
  migration-phases.md
  testing-strategy.md
  service-catalog.yaml
```

`AGENTS.md` is scaffolded from `boundary_scan.json` (setup, test commands, conventions) plus optional analyst sections from `agents_md_analyst_sections` in notes.

## Incremental PR (default)

When `enable_incremental_guidance_pr=true`, the **same** PR is updated before this stage:

| When | Commit message |
|------|----------------|
| After parallel-plan-prep | `docs(monorepo-split): [stage:parallel-plan-prep] …` (opens **draft** PR) |
| After llm-plan-review | `… [stage:llm-plan-review] …` |
| After llm-os-enrichment | `… [stage:llm-os-enrichment] …` |
| This stage (final) | `… [stage:final] …` — PR title/body refreshed |

Track progress in `docs/architecture/WORKFLOW_PROGRESS.md` on the branch.

## Success

- `guidance_pr_url` in notes
- `agents_md_produced=true`
- `stage_summary:open-guidance-pr=ok`

Never push to `${default_branch}`.

## Blockers

- If `service-catalog.yaml` still contains `example-service`, do **not** open a PR — `parallel-plan-prep` / `synthesize-split-plan-runner` must run first.
- If `plan_ok` / `deterministic_plan_produced` is not true, do **not** open a PR.
- **Forbidden:** architect `execute_series` recovery, `create_files`, or manual `git push` — spawn `guidance-pr-runner` only.
- Never commit markdown containing `[HIDDEN:…]` redaction placeholders — use deterministic scaffold output.
